{"candidateAnswer":"12 August, 2023","evidence":"[D18:8 | 2:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Deborah: Gotcha! Visual reminders like this photo can be super motivating. Keep focusing on your goals, Jolene, and don't give up! I led a meditation yoga sessionto the elderly at a local care home last week during sunset. Nature can be really helpful for finding peace. Have you tried mindfulness too? ","itemId":"urn:uuid:4cd30ebd-ade3-53c2-b027-660759055e64","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:636d2016a9ae36b1230db739f88370e57893ee1733a3891ac4671fc1111a1a9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Deborah lead a meditation session during the sunset?","referenceAnswer":"week before 16 August, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"636d2016a9ae36b1230db739f88370e57893ee1733a3891ac4671fc1111a1a9b"}}]}